    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd25 <strong>A Thrilling PvP Third-Person Shooter!</strong> \ud83d\udd25</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gear up and dive into intense action! Fight with friends or against each over! Choose from 7 powerful weapons + grenades!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3511270/extras/9bdf1365408e22ac7194cdd7a030c4f1.poster.avif?t=1741323273\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3511270/extras/9bdf1365408e22ac7194cdd7a030c4f1.webm?t=1741323273\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3511270/extras/9bdf1365408e22ac7194cdd7a030c4f1.mp4?t=1741323273\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udca5 <strong>Dominate the battlefield with tactical buffs!\u00a0</strong>\ud83d\udca5</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use <strong>Shields, Super Jumps, Speed Boosts, or Invisibility</strong> to outplay your enemies and claim victory!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3511270/extras/a39d4d600066ed3b251ed0a2e46fe3c3.poster.avif?t=1741323273\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3511270/extras/a39d4d600066ed3b251ed0a2e46fe3c3.webm?t=1741323273\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3511270/extras/a39d4d600066ed3b251ed0a2e46fe3c3.mp4?t=1741323273\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2694\ufe0f <strong>Multiple Game Modes\u00a0</strong>\u2694\ufe0f</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Craft your own strategy across multiple game modes\u2014<strong>DeathMatch</strong>, <strong>Team Battles</strong>, and <strong>Capture the Flag</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3511270/extras/cc7a5da1295aebde9d91cde3fd8061f9.poster.avif?t=1741323273\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3511270/extras/cc7a5da1295aebde9d91cde3fd8061f9.webm?t=1741323273\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3511270/extras/cc7a5da1295aebde9d91cde3fd8061f9.mp4?t=1741323273\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
