\u2694\ufe0f</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Craft your own strategy across multiple game modes\u2014<strong>DeathMatch</strong>, <strong>Team Battles</strong>, and <strong>Capture the Flag</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3511270/extras/cc7a5da1295aebde9d91cde3fd8061f9.poster.avif?t=1741323273\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3511270/extras/cc7a5da1295aebde9d91cde3fd8061f9.webm?t=1741323273\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3511270/extras/cc7a5da1295aebde9d91cde3fd8061f9.mp4?t=1741323273\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
